 "remarks": "Wow, A Must See Opportunity! This Move In Ready, Spacious Updated Corner End Unit Offers an Abundance of Sunshine and Charm. Ideally Situated on the Main Level. Gorgeous Hardwood Floors Have Just Been Refinished and Entire Unit Freshly Painted Creating a Crisp, Fresh and Inviting Feel Throughout. Exceptional One Bedroom Unit Offers Surprisingly Generous Living Space with Multiple Closets For Fantastic Storage. Bright Living Room with Bay Window, Dining Room with Convenient Walk in Pantry. Lovely Private Patio Area Perfect For Relaxing Or Enjoying Morning Coffee. Even Better HEAT, HOT WATER & COOKING GAS INCLUDED! Reserved Parking Space Close to Your Back Door. Additional Amenities Include Onsite Common Laundry Room and Personal Storage Unit, Conveniently Located Minutes to Transportation, Shopping, Restaurants and Everyday Essentials. Landlord Requires Excellent Credit and References. 2 Months Security Deposit, Liability Insurance, Non Smokers, No Pets. Available for Immediate Occupancy.",
